{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Very kind of you to offer it in the first place\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:43:43.635000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739312449135837264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Do you think it's a good idea to try and turn this into a potion? Lucky told me it helps with pain. You feeling any of that?\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:47:43.960000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739313457131946047","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Yeah I mean I'm usually numb due to the booze but I am getting that same feeling here... I think go for it\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:49:34.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739313920942145574","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Why is that, by the way? I mean, I'd never turn down the occasional shot of whiskey but I wouldn't exactly go for numb.\" She pauses. \"Okay, that was insensitive actually. You lost a lot. You drink. I understand.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:51:38.556000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739314441098625107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"No No you're alright It's a fair question its not exactly a healthy habit...\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:53:39.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739314948714266624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Mostly I think I've just used it as a crutch for the bad things in my life... Ya know the thieves guild doesnt really restrict alcohol from the younger members so\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:54:45.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739315224921768007","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Unhealthy, but it's reasonable.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:56:30.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739315667450462238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Yeah... I should at least try and cut back a bit... but yeah I think it's especially gotten bad in the last 3 months just cuz of everything thats happened... its almost funny just how much has kept going wrong... obviously its not funny but... yeah...\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:57:52.809000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739316010829742084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"What about you? I don't think we've ever really talked much before... How are you doing with everything...\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T02:59:37.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739316451873259643","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Well, I don't really have 'coping habits',\" she makes air quotes with her fingers. \"so I don't know how well I'm dealing with things. I just let them happen. It all feels normal, I guess. I don't have much to compare it to. For now everything is sad but... exciting?\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:01:55.054000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-02T03:05:33.522000Z","id":"739317026878783538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"That is an interesting way to look at things... Life is inherently melancholy I have found... but I haven't quite gotten past it but im trying my best...\" Castor gestures to his knight emblem","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:05:40.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739317973298184192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Melancholy,\" Vee tastes the word. \"We'll see if I can come to the same conclusion. My life hasn't been so long that I can call it melancholy.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:09:25.534000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739318916328849418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Fair... Hopefully it wont ever be melancholy I wouldn't wish that on my worst enemy... In fact I am trying to make more of my life and honor my father... and apparently also my mother turns out my memory of her was wiped from my mind...\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:12:39.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739319730778669117","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
