{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Really? No kidding!\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:13:51.389000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739320031405670493","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Maybe a bit worse for me. But everyone has parents, right? Apparently I even had a brother. But I remember *nothing*.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:15:52.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739320537297322025","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Oh goodness I am sorry... I feel your pain believe me... maybe not to the same extent but still I am sorry... do you know the source of your memory loss?\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:16:57.824000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739320813370605701","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"Well, first of all, there's no pain. I choose not to draw pain from it. I don't think life should be lived looking back. I've made my peace with it years ago.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:29:59.520000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-02T03:30:21.420000Z","id":"739324092041134121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"For the memory loss.... I wouldn't even call it that. It's not like the memories I gave up. There is no gap in my mind where I know those memories used to be. It just feels like... I never had any of those memories. Not a hole, but a wall and I'm not even sure if there is anything behind it. Maybe there is nothing to remember.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:30:05.922000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-02T03:33:20.903000Z","id":"739324118893068361","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"I see... It would have been like that for me but when I joined the knights the sword we have spoke to me in my mind and told me all about it... I wish it hadnt to be honest... I'd rather go on not knowing I had lost those memories... However it is I did lose them\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:33:57.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739325088368689193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"\"I can't exactly go on pretending I didn't lose memories when my first memory is waking up on a floor three years ago. Or maybe I'm fooling myself, and that was the day I was born.\"","created_at":"2020-08-02T03:38:34.086000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-02T03:40:06.816000Z","id":"739326250287628379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
